---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Resources"
  description="Trusted organizations and further reading on pelvic organ prolapse."
  current="/resources/"
>
  <div class="narrow">
    <span class="label">Further reading</span>
    <h1>Where to keep learning</h1>
    <p>
      We link only to established medical organizations and patient advocacy
      groups. If a site is selling you something alongside its advice, read it
      with more care.
    </p>

    <ul class="spaced">
      <li>
        <strong><a href="https://pelvicorganprolapsesupport.org/" rel="noopener">APOPS, the Association for Pelvic Organ Prolapse Support</a></strong><br />
        Global nonprofit advocacy, education, and support forums.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="https://www.yourpelvicfloor.org/" rel="noopener">Your Pelvic Floor</a></strong>, from the International Urogynecological Association<br />
        Plain language patient leaflets in many languages.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cleveland Clinic and Mayo Clinic patient libraries</strong><br />
        Clear articles on prolapse, pessaries, and surgical procedures.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="https://physiotherapy.ca/find-a-physiotherapist/" rel="noopener">Find a Physio, from the Canadian Physiotherapy Association</a></strong><br />
        A directory for finding a pelvic health physiotherapist near you.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="https://menopause.org/" rel="noopener">The Menopause Society</a></strong><br />
        Evidence based information on hormone therapy and menopause.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
